Copyright (c) 2026 ZONO33LHD

This project is a Go port of natural-japanese
(https://github.com/coji/natural-japanese), Copyright (c) 2026 coji,
licensed under the MIT License.

- skills/natural-japanese/ (SKILL.md, references/, assets/) is derived from the
  original repository's skill documents. Script invocations were rewritten to
  use the Go CLI (natural-japanese); the writing guidance itself is unchanged.
- The detector logic, thresholds, catalogs and messages in usecase/ are ported
  from the original Python scripts (lint.py, textcore.py, outline.py, terms.py,
  semantic.py, calibrate.py).
- testdata/fixtures/ is copied from the original repository.

Morphological analysis uses sudachin-go (https://github.com/ZONO33LHD/sudachin-go)
with the SudachiDict system dictionary, which is distributed separately under its
own license (Apache License 2.0) and is not included in this repository.
